WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:09.540
I'm the first spacecraft ever to circle Mercury, the planet closest to the Sun.

2
00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:14.640
I wore a sunshade like a giant umbrella so I wouldn't cook.

3
00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:21.450
I found ice hiding in craters at Mercury's poles, where sunlight never reaches.

4
00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:27.870
When my fuel ran out, I crashed into the planet I'd studied for four years.

5
00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:33.320
Out of fuel, I flew on the gas that was only meant to push it.
